WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.461
Markets move.

2
00:00:01.861 --> 00:00:03.439
Industries evolve.

3
00:00:03.639 --> 00:00:06.048
Technology changes how businesses compete.

4
00:00:06.048 --> 00:00:10.513
Unique Holding is an international business group operating across

5
00:00:10.513 --> 00:00:18.672
two connected worlds: technology, intelligence and new business — and
energy, petrochemicals and global industrial trade.

6
00:00:18.672 --> 00:00:22.912
Since 2020, the group has combined commercial execution with an

7
00:00:22.912 --> 00:00:27.152
expanding technology platform — studying markets, supporting

8
00:00:27.152 --> 00:00:32.256
businesses, developing new products, and conducting
international trade.

9
00:00:32.256 --> 00:00:36.738
A growing part of Unique Holding’s work is built around intelligence.

10
00:00:36.738 --> 00:00:40.765
For most companies, the challenge is not a lack of information.

11
00:00:40.765 --> 00:00:43.272
The challenge is knowing what matters.

12
00:00:43.472 --> 00:00:44.599
What changed.

13
00:00:44.999 --> 00:00:46.596
Which competitor moved.

14
00:00:46.996 --> 00:00:48.697
What a market is signaling.

15
00:00:48.897 --> 00:00:50.778
Which assumptions are becoming outdated.

16
00:00:50.978 --> 00:00:52.888
And what the next move should be.

17
00:00:53.088 --> 00:00:57.830
The group works across market research, competitive analysis, product

18
00:00:57.830 --> 00:01:07.392
thinking, business strategy, content systems and AI-enabled workflows
— especially for companies operating in American and European markets.

19
00:01:07.392 --> 00:01:14.160
At the center of this capability is Evidence Axis — the group’s
specialist competitive-intelligence venture.

20
00:01:14.160 --> 00:01:22.608
Evidence Axis studies market movement, competitor behavior,
positioning changes, product development and public signals.

21
00:01:22.608 --> 00:01:28.258
The work begins with discovery: what is happening that a company may
not yet be seeing?

22
00:01:28.258 --> 00:01:32.496
Then verification: what does the evidence actually establish?

23
00:01:32.696 --> 00:01:35.085
Fact is separated from inference.

24
00:01:35.485 --> 00:01:37.093
Sources are traced.

25
00:01:37.293 --> 00:01:39.377
Competitive assumptions are tested.

26
00:01:39.377 --> 00:01:42.960
And findings are translated into decision-ready intelligence.

27
00:01:42.960 --> 00:01:47.215
The result can include market research, competitive analysis,

28
00:01:47.215 --> 00:01:55.488
Executive Briefs, Evidence Appendices, decision implications,
business blueprints and practical strategic direction.

29
00:01:55.488 --> 00:02:00.263
Evidence Axis also follows a research-led approach
to business development.

30
00:02:00.263 --> 00:02:05.544
Selected companies can first receive substantial complimentary
intelligence work.

31
00:02:05.544 --> 00:02:09.886
A company is studied, a meaningful issue is identified, evidence is

32
00:02:09.886 --> 00:02:15.600
assembled, and a focused research package is delivered around a real
business decision.

33
00:02:15.600 --> 00:02:20.616
But research becomes valuable only when it changes what happens next.

34
00:02:20.616 --> 00:02:23.683
Competitive movement can reshape positioning.

35
00:02:23.683 --> 00:02:26.601
Market analysis can alter product direction.

36
00:02:26.601 --> 00:02:30.192
A strong idea still needs a practical route to execution.

37
00:02:30.192 --> 00:02:34.421
That is why the broader technology platform connects research with

38
00:02:34.421 --> 00:02:38.576
product management, business planning, market-entry strategy,

39
00:02:38.576 --> 00:02:44.808
go-to-market thinking, professional content development and
AI-assisted execution workflows.

40
00:02:44.808 --> 00:02:49.203
The output may take the form of a business blueprint, a product

41
00:02:49.203 --> 00:02:54.696
roadmap, a content system, a market strategy or a
structured execution plan.

42
00:02:54.696 --> 00:02:59.400
The goal is simple: clearer decisions and more practical movement.

43
00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:04.176
Unique Holding also builds new digital products and venture concepts.

44
00:03:04.176 --> 00:03:12.960
New digital products and venture concepts move through research,
product design, software development, testing and iteration.

45
00:03:13.160 --> 00:03:15.269
Some begin as early concepts.

46
00:03:15.669 --> 00:03:17.843
Others move into active build.

47
00:03:18.043 --> 00:03:22.033
Projects such as Listener reflect this product-development capability

48
00:03:22.033 --> 00:03:27.504
in practice, while additional products and venture concepts continue
to be explored and developed.

49
00:03:27.504 --> 00:03:36.192
The principle remains consistent: understand the problem, build
deliberately, test reality, and improve what deserves to grow.

50
00:03:36.192 --> 00:03:40.652
Alongside technology and intelligence, Unique Holding operates in

51
00:03:40.652 --> 00:03:46.728
energy-related products, petrochemicals, industrial chemicals and
international trade.

52
00:03:46.728 --> 00:03:57.096
Since 2020, its commercial activity has included import, domestic
supply, export and re-export across industrial product categories.

53
00:03:57.096 --> 00:04:01.762
The process begins with a real commercial requirement: the product,

54
00:04:01.762 --> 00:04:08.520
the grade, the specification, the quantity, the destination and the
required delivery structure.

55
00:04:08.520 --> 00:04:16.416
From there, the work moves through sourcing, commercial review,
documentation, logistics and execution.

56
00:04:16.416 --> 00:04:20.793
The group’s commercial work has included European markets such as

57
00:04:20.793 --> 00:04:25.249
Germany, Serbia and Austria, across product categories including

58
00:04:25.249 --> 00:04:30.720
Industrial Urea 46, caustic soda and other
petrochemical and chemical materials.

59
00:04:30.720 --> 00:04:35.219
This is practical international trade — understanding products,

60
00:04:35.219 --> 00:04:43.896
markets, counterparties, documentation and the physical movement
required to deliver industrial materials across borders.

61
00:05:02.096 --> 00:05:03.424
Different businesses.

62
00:05:03.824 --> 00:05:04.697
One group.

63
00:05:05.097 --> 00:05:06.301
Different markets.

64
00:05:06.701 --> 00:05:07.946
Different products.

65
00:05:08.346 --> 00:05:09.674
One operating mindset.

66
00:05:10.074 --> 00:05:11.610
Understand the environment.

67
00:05:12.010 --> 00:05:13.338
Identify what matters.

68
00:05:13.738 --> 00:05:15.149
Build the right response.

69
00:05:15.549 --> 00:05:16.960
And execute with clarity.

70
00:05:17.360 --> 00:05:18.469
Unique Holding.

71
00:05:18.869 --> 00:05:20.457
Intelligence to understand.

72
00:05:20.857 --> 00:05:22.141
Technology to build.

73
00:05:22.541 --> 00:05:23.824
Commerce to execute.
